Native IPQ5018 NSS-DP with opt-in upstream phylink management.

Keep SSDK-managed ports on the existing path. The new helper handles
MAC clocks, PHY/PCS link state and 2.5G encoding for the CR881x variant.
Preserve probe deferral and remove only the bound platform port.

